This case reports the SHAPE of the allocator's fresh-byte curve, so its
output is deliberately different with reclamation off: "flat" with free
on, "grows" with free off. That is the property it exists to assert, and
the *FixturesFreeMatchesNoFree gates therefore invert for it.

See alloc_flat_under_reclaim's marker for why the inversion is a claim
being checked rather than a check being skipped.
